WEBVTT

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:03.176
I would propose we ask
some more difficult questions,

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.400
questions like:

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:08.096
How do you decide who deserves your love

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.360
and who does not?

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:14.096
How do you stay in love
when things get difficult,

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.640
and how do you know
when to just cut and run?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.776
How do you live with the doubt

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.816
that inevitably creeps
into every relationship,

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.456
or even harder,

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.840
how do you live with your partner's doubt?

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:31.416
I don't necessarily know
the answers to these questions,